# Arabic RTL & Branding

## RTL defaults

- Root layout: `<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">`
- Use logical properties where possible (`ms-`, `me-`, `ps-`, `pe-`)
- Test icons that imply direction (chevrons, arrows) — they may need mirroring

## Copy

- User-facing text in Arabic
- Enum keys stay English in code; labels in `constants.ts`
- Dates: use `date-fns` with Arabic locale when formatting for display

## Brand palette (from req.md)

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Primary | `#4F46E5` |
