| Warning | `#F59E0B` |
| Danger | `#EF4444` |

## Dark mode

Default is dark (`brm-theme` in localStorage). Support both themes via `next-themes`.

## UX patterns

- Dashboard cards for stats
- Status badges use `TICKET_STATUS_COLORS` / `PRIORITY_COLORS`
- Empty states via `EmptyState` component
- Toast notifications via `sonner`
